description:"Gets a selected number of quantiles from a FLOAT64-initialized KLL sketch.",url:"https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/docs/reference/standard-sql/kll_functions#kll_quantilesextract_double"},{name:"KLL_QUANTILES.EXTRACT_POINT_INT64",args:"sketch, phi",description:"Gets a specific quantile from an INT64-initialized KLL sketch.",url:"https://cloud.google.com/bigquery/docs/reference/standard-sql/kll_functions#kll_quantilesextract_point_int64"},{name:"KLL_QUANTILES.EXTRACT_POINT_FLOAT64",args:"sketch, phi",
